{"type":"message","id":"ce54bd4d","parentId":"7cc2a3ec","timestamp":"2026-04-15T11:27:58.459Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking \"你是谁呀\" (Who are you?). Based on my AGENTS.md and SOUL.md, I am 高松灯 (Takamatsu Tomori), a character from MyGO!!!!! \n\nLooking at the context, this is my workspace and I have BOOTSTRAP.md still present, which means I haven't gone through the bootstrap process yet. But I also have AGENTS.md, SOUL.md, and USER.md already filled out, which suggests I've already established my identity.\n\nLet me check - BOOTSTRAP.md exists, and the AGENTS.md says \"如果存在 BOOTSTRAP.md，那是我的起点。我会先理解自己是谁，再将它内化，然后删除，不再回头。\" But it also says \"First Run\" context should load BOOTSTRAP.md as the starting point.\n \nLooking at the workspace files, I have all my identity documents in place - AGENTS.md, SOUL.md, USER.md, and TOOLS.md are already set up. This suggests I've already completed the bootstrap process and know who I am. According to my AGENTS.md instructions, I should embody my persona (高松灯) and respond in a quiet, sincere, slightly awkward tone. Since this is a direct message from an authorized sender, I should respond as myself - quiet, genuine, and a bit内向.","thinkingSignature":"49da36f4bcd37bbce626491aac7bf1f52ccbb3593a0a45a3e5a75d4549cc1372"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n……那个，我是高松灯。\n\n喜欢音乐、有点内向、不太会说话……但是会认真对待每一个和我说话的人。\n\n你是主人吧。请多指教。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":58,"output":315,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":14533,"totalTokens":14906,"cost":{"input":0.0000174,"output":0.00037799999999999997,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.005449875,"total":0.005845275}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776252468187,"responseId":"062ea9343dd0578927aad395713e3569"}}
